SOUND: DD2_SOUND=1 enables the DirectSound COM shim boot path

The launchers force DAT_00462d68=1 before Init_Application so FUN_004159f8
skips DirectSoundCreate (the proven no-sound path all Stage-2 video verify
ran on). With DD2_SOUND=1 the flag is left 0 so the REAL DS init runs against
the vtable COM shim in dd2h_stubs.c (buffers/Play/SetFreq/Pan/Vol/GetStatus,
cf-deterministic lifetime; DD2_SNDLOG=1 call log) - groundwork for the
bit-identical audio mixdown. Default behavior is unchanged.

--- a/dd2_runtime.c
+++ b/dd2_runtime.c
@@ -86,7 +86,9 @@
        Read_Directory("DIRINFO"), Read_CD_Toc_, Load_Game_Vags -- the VAG load fills the audio
        staging 0x7fa164-0x816ff0 byte-identical to the reference. */
     { extern void Init_Main(void); Init_Main(); }
-    *(int*)0x462d68 = 1;  /* during init: make FUN_004159a8 skip DirectSound COM setup */
+    /* DD2_SOUND=1: run the real DirectSoundCreate against the COM shim in dd2h_stubs.c
+       (FUN_004159f8 sets 0x462d68=1 itself on success). Default: skip = proven no-sound path. */
+    *(int*)0x462d68 = getenv("DD2_SOUND") ? 0 : 1;
     Init_Application((void*)1);
     /* front-end normally sets the video mode (creates the DDraw primary surface) before the race;
        the cold Play_Game bypass skips it -> Set_Draw_Mode(0) here so SetPalette's surface exists.
@@ -94,7 +96,7 @@
     _current_level = (argc>1)?atoi(argv[1]):1;
     *(int*)0x463010 = -1;
     Set_Draw_Mode(0);
-    *(int*)0x462d68 = 0;  /* before the race loop: sound funcs (Modify_Sound etc.) skip uninit DirectSound COM (audio = deferred WebAudio tier) */
+    if(!getenv("DD2_SOUND")) *(int*)0x462d68 = 0;  /* no-sound default: sound funcs skip uninit DirectSound COM */
     if (argc>1 && argv[1][0]=='f' && argv[1][1]=='e') {
       extern void Init_Front_End(void); extern void Front_End(void); extern void Setup_Pad(int);
       /* Parity with tools/native_main.c's DD2_FE path: race_type/race_mode = 0 (valid string-
